      "ACTION-REPAIR revises its proof when the adversarial falsifier finds a valid counterexample",
      "ACTION-REPAIR applies the minimal source repair only when the falsification gate is exhausted without a valid counterexample",
      "ACTION-HISTORIAN-3 records every attempt and every failure",
